{"id":"3ddc5c0eefd8ae40","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation.md","title":"ZFC Poset Way Below Relation","display":"df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation — ZFC Poset Way Below Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation — ZFC Poset Way Below Relation","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation — ZFC Poset Way Below Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,P,\\leq\\in V\">\\(x,y,P,\\leq\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectedSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectedSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Supremum}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Supremum}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetWayBelowRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetWayBelowRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}directed\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectedSubset}_S(D,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\nD\\subseteq P\\land D\\neq\\emptyset\\land\n\\forall d,e\\in D\\;\\exists u\\in D\\;(\n\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land\\langle e,u\\rangle\\in\\leq)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}directed\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectedSubset}_S(D,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\nD\\subseteq P\\land D\\neq\\emptyset\\land\n\\forall d,e\\in D\\;\\exists u\\in D\\;(\n\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land\\langle e,u\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}supremum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Supremum}_S(s,D,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\ns\\in P\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\land\n\\forall u\\in P\\;\\bigl((\\forall d\\in D\\;\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq)\n\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}supremum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Supremum}_S(s,D,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\ns\\in P\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\land\n\\forall u\\in P\\;\\bigl((\\forall d\\in D\\;\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq)\n\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}way\\text{-}below\\text{-}relation} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetWayBelowRelation}_S(x,y,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land x,y\\in P\\land\n\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\forall s\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{DirectedSubset}_S(D,P,\\leq)\\land\\mathrm{Supremum}_S(s,D,P,\\leq)\\land\n\\langle y,s\\rangle\\in\\leq\n\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\langle x,d\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}way\\text{-}below\\text{-}relation} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetWayBelowRelation}_S(x,y,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land x,y\\in P\\land\n\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\forall s\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{DirectedSubset}_S(D,P,\\leq)\\land\\mathrm{Supremum}_S(s,D,P,\\leq)\\land\n\\langle y,s\\rangle\\in\\leq\n\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\langle x,d\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Suprema are quantified only when they exist; every comparison is expressed through the declared order relation, and no total supremum operator is assumed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,y,P,\\leq\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectedSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Supremum}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetWayBelowRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}directed\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectedSubset}_S(D,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\nD\\subseteq P\\land D\\neq\\emptyset\\land\n\\forall d,e\\in D\\;\\exists u\\in D\\;(\n\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land\\langle e,u\\rangle\\in\\leq)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}supremum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Supremum}_S(s,D,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\ns\\in P\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\land\n\\forall u\\in P\\;\\bigl((\\forall d\\in D\\;\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq)\n\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}way\\text{-}below\\text{-}relation} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetWayBelowRelation}_S(x,y,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land x,y\\in P\\land\n\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\forall s\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{DirectedSubset}_S(D,P,\\leq)\\land\\mathrm{Supremum}_S(s,D,P,\\leq)\\land\n\\langle y,s\\rangle\\in\\leq\n\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\langle x,d\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1700,"backlinks":[{"id":"9b989a62f7579fbb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetWayBelowRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation.md|58-df-zfc-poset-way-below-relation]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018"]}